(7425342, 1172028, 142425, '<td valign="top">Basically a single line of shoes constructed from a single shot of a shoe on a black background. A second line was flipped from the first.<br/> <br/>The lines were repeated to make a full size backgound and then colounised. A second layer was added at a different angle, blended, and colourised.<br/> <br/>Finally a third layer consisting of one line of shoes in a circle on a transparent background, repeated at different sizes, and colourised.<br/> <br/>The image was then distorted into a bubble with a preset filter.<br/> <br/>For the fashion conscious the shoe is by Barbour.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Basically a single line of shoes constructed from a single shot of a shoe on a black background. A second line was flipped from the first. The lines were repeated to make a full size backgound and then colounised. A second layer was added at a different angle, blended, and colourised. Finally a third layer consisting of one line of shoes in a circle on a transparent background, repeated at different sizes, and colourised. The image was then distorted into a bubble with a preset filter. For the fashion conscious the shoe is by Barbour. ', '2016-01-02 09:39:08.000000', NULL, 0),
